</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/672e759a-6af7-11f1-b19a-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B7GU3NX.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/672e759a-6af7-11f1-b19a-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B7GU3NX.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">9e6eaf0e-6b59-11f1-810d-1349aaa31bec</guid><pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 21:06:47 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/672e759a-6af7-11f1-b19a-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B7GU3NX.jpg">© AFP</source><dc:creator>法广</dc:creator></item><item><category>要闻分析</category><title>美伊备忘录签署后 60天谈判期从6月18日算起</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E8%A6%81%E9%97%BB%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/20260618-%E7%BE%8E%E4%BC%8A%E5%A4%87%E5%BF%98%E5%BD%95%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E5%90%8E-60%E5%A4%A9%E8%B0%88%E5%88%A4%E6%9C%9F%E4%BB%8E18%E6%97%A5%E7%AE%97%E8%B5%B7</link><description>
